rfc4269.txt
    Extracted by a script from RFC 4269, "The SEED Encryption Algorithm", https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4269.txt,
    downloaded on 2026-10-24: the extended S-boxes SS0 to SS3 of appendix A.2 and the test vectors of appendix B.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the vectors are data.
    Format: Key = Value records; hexadecimal values. The record "Extended S-boxes" lists the 256 entries of SS0 to SS3;
    each test vector has the key, plaintext and ciphertext, RoundKeys (Ki0 || Ki1 of the rounds 1 to 16) and
    RoundInputs (L0 || L1 || R0 || R1 before each of the rounds 1 to 16).
    Used: every record.

